        "created_at": "2025-07-12T09:57:59.719319+00:00",
        "notes": "On round 6 and onwards we will start gathering our utility items such as  [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505)  and  [Liquid Nitrogen](item_a8d99526-05a3-4405-babb-b025479b1b98)  The reason why i chose these items is because they proc with  [Calamity](item_d6cdfbfe-61f4-4aa2-979f-f7793000b15c)  and since you have  [Double Barrelled](item_962b847f-140d-41a4-9bac-ddcdb088951e) you can keep using Coach gun to have 2 burning bullets which will then proc  [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505)  and  [Liquid Nitrogen](item_a8d99526-05a3-4405-babb-b025479b1b98)  not only this will provide us utility but also it will make it easier to hit follow up shots thanks to  [Liquid Nitrogen](item_a8d99526-05a3-4405-babb-b025479b1b98)",
